  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From equation of radioactivity.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mn>700</mn><mn>500</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>min</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;------<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>also</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;--------<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"fraktur\">ii</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>/</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"fraktur\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>min</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06004</mn><mo>)</mo><mn>30</mn>